Package: com.nightvibes33.gif2ani
Name: Gif2Ani Rootless
Version: 3.5.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: com.nightvibes33.darkboot, com.wizage.gif2ani2, com.wizages.gif2ani
Replaces: com.nightvibes33.darkboot
Description: Crash-safe custom respring animations for BackBoard on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Gif2Ani 3.5.5 regenerates all 48 bundled Springy package records directly from immutable raw Git DEBs, verifies every size, SHA-256, package identifier, architecture, and artwork set, and derives each visible pack name from the DEB Name field while preserving real qualifiers such as DankerThings. It provides 114 first-class themes: 12 offline procedural animations, 54 pinned CC0 GIF downloads, and 48 original Springy pack downloads from the verified MIT-licensed VirenMohindra/CydiaRepo catalog. Every download is previewed and staged before Apply; catalog files are checked by host, byte limit, SHA-256, package identity, archive paths, extracted size, frame count, dimensions, and decoded-memory limits. The tweak preserves user-selected scaling, background, repeat, and duration settings, discovers installed Springy and SnowBoard packs, supports safe GIF/ZIP/DEB/frame-folder import, and automatically quarantines unsafe BackBoard media.
Maintainer: NightVibes33
Author: wizages, rootless port by NightVibes33
Section: Tweaks
